Uh to the interiors of the exterior tent and provides uh hopefully bug free uh waterproof floor bathtub floor uh.
扣到外帐内部，形成一个她希望能防虫、防水的盆状帐底。

6
00:01:18,720 --> 00:01:33,430
So it's a nice secure place in the summer which keeps the crawlies and the the little flying guys out and uh makes a nice space inside.
所以夏天里面是个舒服安心的空间，能把爬虫和小飞虫挡在外面，形成不错的内部空间。

7
00:01:33,440 --> 00:01:40,399
I'm going to be using my quilt tonight um it's going to be one of those nights when I don't need the down.
今晚我会用我的被子。今天夜里应该不需要羽绒。

